Standard Nethack meaning - If something is 97.5% likely, it is not
good enough to use when in combat with Demigorgon or the Wiz!

But if the possible shortest time is a few moves, then it does make
sense to use the Orb to shuttle items to your stash.  Explore for a
while, gather as much as you can carry, enough time has passed
that you are sure you can level teleport to home base.  Work with
your stash a bit to BUC id the new items and organize them into
stacks, and maybe the Orb will be happy to take you directly down
to the exploration level again.  If the Orb isn't happy that moment,
walk down and all is level.

